“Souqak” Platform Project
The Integrated Multi-Vendor E-Commerce Marketplace – 2025 Edition
Project Overview

“Souqak” is a next-generation Saudi e-commerce platform operating as a Multi-Vendor Marketplace. It enables any individual or company to create their own online store within the platform in just minutes, while allowing full centralized management by the platform owner.

Current Numbers (as of November 19, 2025)

Registered active sellers: 4,829 sellers

Total listed products: 187,432 products

Total sales value since the beta launch: 48.7 million SAR

Average daily sales in November 2025: 1,840,000 SAR

Total completed orders: 428,391 orders

Average order value: 285 SAR

Daily visitors: more than 180,000 visitors per day

Key Features of the Platform

Automatic seller registration system with commercial registration and IBAN verification

Separate dashboard for each seller (product management – inventory – orders – wallet – reports)

Flexible commission system (fixed, percentage-based, or category-based)

Automatic order splitting (Split Order) when multiple sellers are involved

12 Saudi and international payment gateways
(Mada, Visa, Mastercard, Tabby, Tamara, Lean, Apple Pay, STC Pay, bank transfer)

Smart integrated shipping engine with Aramex, SMSA, Zajil, FedEx, DHL, and SPL

Discount coupon system (platform-wide or seller-specific)

Product and store ratings & reviews

Automatic return and exchange system with shipping label printing

Instant notifications (Push – SMS – Email – WhatsApp Business)

Mobile apps for customers and sellers (iOS + Android) – completed and published

Full support for Arabic and English with RTL layout

Auctions and special offers management system

Loyalty and reward points program

Advanced analytics reports using Laravel Nova + Power BI

Technologies Used

Laravel 11 + PHP 8.3

MySQL + Redis + Elasticsearch

Microservices for payments, shipping, and notifications

Queue System (Horizon + Redis)

Ready APIs for mobile apps (Sanctum + Passport)

Server setup: 8 high-performance servers (Nginx + PHP-FPM)

Current Status

94% of the project is completed – ready for official launch within just 10 days.